WEBVTT

00:02.910 --> 00:04.230
I found you, bro!

00:04.800 --> 00:06.190
What are you up to?

00:06.190 --> 00:07.220
Eruca.

00:07.490 --> 00:08.710
Hey there!

00:08.710 --> 00:11.350
So this is Natalia, who 
I've heard so much about.

00:11.350 --> 00:12.770
Who is this?

00:12.770 --> 00:14.830
Allen's little sister.

00:14.830 --> 00:17.000
The Great Demon Lord's sister?!

00:17.650 --> 00:20.860
I presume you must be an 
accomplished sorcerer yourself.

00:20.860 --> 00:23.820
Not as much as my bro.

00:23.820 --> 00:25.340
So, what are you up to?

00:25.340 --> 00:29.290
I'm learning and exercising what 
the Great Demon Lord calls,

00:29.290 --> 00:30.900
"How to conquer the academy."

00:30.900 --> 00:31.750
Say what?!

00:31.750 --> 00:34.130
If you know how to defeat 
your opponents effectively,

00:34.130 --> 00:36.270
then you can wipe out all your 
enemies from the academy!

00:36.270 --> 00:37.770
What are you talking about?

00:37.770 --> 00:40.530
It is most effective to 
challenge the enemy leader

00:40.530 --> 00:43.790
in a field they excel in and show 
the difference in your abilities.

00:43.790 --> 00:46.030
Jeez, that's nasty.

00:46.320 --> 00:48.780
The only thing left is the 
duel with your rival, Chris.

00:48.780 --> 00:51.020
Take the flag at the back of the dungeon.

00:51.020 --> 00:53.130
The first one to return with it is the winner.

00:53.130 --> 00:55.770
Victory will be mine!

00:56.030 --> 01:01.170
If you'd like, I can teach you a 
secret trick that's barely legal.

01:01.170 --> 01:02.980
Fascinating.

01:02.980 --> 01:05.050
I would love that.

01:05.790 --> 01:09.580
I have high hopes that you'll 
be able to use it well.

01:11.250 --> 01:14.540
I thought you were supposed to 
guide her to the right path.

01:14.540 --> 01:19.320
I-I feel like Natalia is 
becoming a naughty girl...!

01:22.010 --> 01:26.600
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

02:50.440 --> 02:51.300
Damn it!

02:50.560 --> 02:55.020
<b>Naughty Dungeon</b>

02:51.300 --> 02:52.520
You'll pay for this!

02:52.820 --> 02:54.730
Let's go, guys!

02:55.450 --> 02:58.270
He'll probably forget about it by tonight.

02:58.530 --> 03:01.390
I didn't expect you to beat him 
by more than 30 minutes...

03:01.390 --> 03:03.290
You're incredible, Natalia!

03:03.290 --> 03:04.870
You're on a whole other level.

03:04.870 --> 03:07.010
Thank you for the compliments, I'm honored.

03:07.010 --> 03:08.770
By the way, that dungeon...

03:09.080 --> 03:11.300
Why is entry forbidden?

03:11.680 --> 03:17.300
Well... the dungeon boss is in her 
laying season, so she's agitated.

03:17.300 --> 03:18.790
Boss Lady!

03:19.490 --> 03:21.040
Thank you for your hard work.

03:21.040 --> 03:24.270
I've taught the guy who tried 
to use me as a gofer a lesson.

03:24.270 --> 03:27.050
I beat up the spoiled brat from 
the main branch of the family!

03:27.050 --> 03:30.200
I threw the guy who stole my 
girlfriend into the ocean!

03:30.200 --> 03:31.820
Well done.

03:31.820 --> 03:33.950
I'm proud to have you as my underlings.

03:33.950 --> 03:37.450
T-To be complimented by Boss Lady...

03:38.540 --> 03:40.310
We owe all of this...

03:40.310 --> 03:42.440
to your dedicated instructions, Professor...

03:42.920 --> 03:44.450
Professor Gosetsu!

03:44.780 --> 03:47.440
I cannot thank you enough.

03:47.440 --> 03:50.690
You must be an accomplished hell capybara.

03:50.690 --> 03:54.240
Oh no, all I've done is use a little bit 
of the carrot-and-stick approach.

03:54.240 --> 03:56.470
I'm just an old timer.

03:58.420 --> 04:00.890
Come on, break time is over!

04:00.890 --> 04:03.470
Now go run a lap of the island!

04:03.790 --> 04:06.890
Work hard so you won't be 
a burden to Miss Natalia!

04:06.890 --> 04:08.770
Sir, yes, sir!

04:09.710 --> 04:11.840
I want to play tag, too!

04:12.220 --> 04:13.340
Excuse me.

04:13.990 --> 04:17.390
I'll leave them in your hands, 
Professor Gosetsu, Lü.

04:17.390 --> 04:18.240
Hey!

04:18.240 --> 04:21.980
You call Gosetsu "Professor," but 
I'm still the Great Demon Lord?

04:22.270 --> 04:24.380
The Great Demon Lord is the Great Demon Lord.

04:24.380 --> 04:26.090
Don't get cocky.

04:31.500 --> 04:34.020
It's almost time for dinner.

04:34.020 --> 04:36.720
Right. Let's go to the cafeteria.

04:36.720 --> 04:39.210
We should have another strategy meeting.

04:39.210 --> 04:40.020
Yes.

04:40.420 --> 04:43.500
But you have to eat some vegetables, too.

04:43.500 --> 04:46.830
I-I've been eating them recently!

04:46.830 --> 04:48.730
Since you insist.

04:54.470 --> 04:56.750
Here you go, veggies.

04:57.010 --> 05:00.010
I-I'm rather full today.

05:00.010 --> 05:01.620
Is that so?

05:01.620 --> 05:04.770
I chose them for your health...

05:06.780 --> 05:09.630
I-I'll eat them! I will!

05:15.590 --> 05:18.040
A-Are you happy now?

05:18.040 --> 05:20.040
Wow! Good job!

05:20.040 --> 05:21.370
Wonderful!

05:21.370 --> 05:23.040
Impressive, Natalia!

05:23.040 --> 05:24.530
Of course.

05:24.530 --> 05:26.810
I'm an adult now.

05:26.810 --> 05:29.340
Then how about seconds?

05:29.340 --> 05:31.060
There's plenty more!

05:33.060 --> 05:36.240
Those two are already acting 
like totally great sisters.

05:36.240 --> 05:38.680
I hope it happens in real life.

05:38.680 --> 05:40.650
Oh, you haven't asked?

05:40.650 --> 05:42.020
About her sister.

05:42.020 --> 05:45.580
No. It seems like it's a land mine for her.

05:45.990 --> 05:50.120
Please do not bring up that 
subject in front of me again.

05:51.590 --> 05:54.800
I'm still building trust.

05:54.800 --> 05:57.200
It's better to take some more time.

05:57.200 --> 05:58.470
Oh yeah?

05:58.470 --> 06:00.250
It's only natural that you'd be cautious.

06:00.250 --> 06:02.960
It's an important issue for your partner.

06:02.960 --> 06:05.300
That's <i>just</i> a pretense!

06:05.300 --> 06:09.470
I don't know how long you can 
use that as an excuse...

06:12.360 --> 06:16.470
Setting that aside for now, what 
is your plan after this is over?

06:16.470 --> 06:21.160
Let's see, Natalia's situation 
seems to be settled for now,

06:21.160 --> 06:24.120
so maybe I'll look into that case.

06:24.120 --> 06:26.480
Dad said he'd help, too.

06:27.990 --> 06:29.990
Ch-Charlo?

06:29.990 --> 06:31.230
Yes?

06:31.230 --> 06:36.740
I-I've been thinking that I 
should teach you a new spell.

06:36.740 --> 06:38.240
Are you sure?!

06:38.240 --> 06:40.500
You have training with Allen...

06:40.800 --> 06:44.250
He said that I should teach 
you the basics of magic.

06:44.250 --> 06:46.500
But if you don't want to...

06:46.770 --> 06:48.250
That would be lovely!

06:48.250 --> 06:52.480
Then let's start early tomorrow 
morning before class.

06:52.480 --> 06:55.330
Yes! I'll do my best!

06:55.870 --> 06:58.020
Thank you for your work, Boss Lady!

06:58.360 --> 07:00.570
You're finished with your training?

07:00.570 --> 07:01.820
Yes, Boss Lady.

07:01.820 --> 07:04.850
If you're training, let us join you.

07:04.850 --> 07:07.280
We don't mind teaching 
her, too, if you want—

07:08.300 --> 07:11.280
It's a million years too early for you, small fry!

07:12.770 --> 07:15.460
Come on now, resume running!

07:23.480 --> 07:25.910
Hey, we're here, Natalia.

07:25.910 --> 07:28.180
This is Boss Lady's room.

07:32.320 --> 07:34.920
We did work very hard today.

07:34.920 --> 07:36.320
Hm...

07:37.670 --> 07:39.290
Very diligent of her.

07:39.290 --> 07:41.920
She's studying a lot.

07:45.950 --> 07:47.190
What's this?

07:47.190 --> 07:49.550
It's dangerous to touch that bag.

07:49.550 --> 07:51.750
You'll be beaten up without mercy.

07:51.750 --> 07:54.190
Is it something important to her?

07:56.690 --> 08:00.090
<i>It seems to be sealed with magic, too.</i>

08:00.090 --> 08:04.950
<i>It's biometrically locked, and if you try 
to force it open, it'll trigger a trap.</i>

08:05.260 --> 08:07.440
What's in it?

08:07.440 --> 08:08.480
Who knows?

08:08.480 --> 08:11.970
Boss Lady doesn't talk about herself much.

08:11.970 --> 08:14.020
Shoot, look at the time.

08:14.020 --> 08:15.340
Excuse me.

08:18.850 --> 08:20.480
You again, Chris?

08:20.480 --> 08:22.600
Are you here to give Natalia 
a challenge letter?

08:22.600 --> 08:23.970
Sh-Shut up!

08:25.220 --> 08:27.320
What the heck did he want?

08:27.320 --> 08:30.220
I gotta go to my part time 
job, so please excuse me!

08:30.220 --> 08:32.110
Yes, take care.

08:37.640 --> 08:39.860
It must be very important.

08:41.880 --> 08:43.240
My goodness.

08:43.240 --> 08:45.620
Looking like this, she's 
just a normal child.

08:45.620 --> 08:48.240
Yes. It reminds me of old times.

08:49.240 --> 08:52.670
In the past, I would read books to her.

08:53.530 --> 08:58.380
She listened happily, but she would 
fall asleep halfway through...

09:00.960 --> 09:03.460
I can't believe she's grown so big.

09:05.590 --> 09:06.880
Charlotte.

09:07.130 --> 09:12.400
Perhaps I should... keep 
my identity a secret.

09:12.630 --> 09:14.330
Why do you think so?

09:14.740 --> 09:17.880
I got to talk to Natalia 
about a lot of things.

09:17.880 --> 09:22.000
But... she never talks about her family.

09:22.400 --> 09:24.650
I think that's her answer.

09:25.410 --> 09:28.450
I must remind her of terrible memories.

09:28.450 --> 09:30.930
If so, then she should just forget about me.

09:30.930 --> 09:32.240
But why?

09:32.240 --> 09:34.580
Mommy and Natalia are so close.

09:34.580 --> 09:36.670
But you want her to forget about you?

09:36.670 --> 09:40.830
That's because it's Charlo, Allen's 
assistant, and not myself.

09:40.830 --> 09:44.060
But mommy is mommy, and Natalia is Natalia.

09:44.060 --> 09:46.680
I want you two to get along.

09:47.180 --> 09:48.450
Lü...

09:50.940 --> 09:54.480
Well, you don't need to 
rush to a conclusion yet.

09:54.480 --> 09:56.690
Why don't you take your 
time and think it over?

09:56.690 --> 09:58.980
Exactly.

09:58.980 --> 10:02.460
More often than not, time will 
solve this type of problem.

10:02.710 --> 10:07.470
You can watch over Miss 
Natalia in the long run.

10:07.830 --> 10:09.630
As expected from the oldest of us all.

10:09.630 --> 10:12.520
Your advice has weight to it.

10:12.520 --> 10:15.260
I have gone through a lot.

10:15.260 --> 10:17.470
Once upon a time,

10:17.470 --> 10:21.080
I was half asleep and accidentally reduced 
the volcanic belt in the East to ashes.

10:21.080 --> 10:24.500
But now, that area is a 
beautiful green plain.

10:24.500 --> 10:28.980
You could say that time is a cure-all 
for anything and everything.

10:28.980 --> 10:33.490
Wait, isn't that the famous story about 
the natural disaster of unknown cause?

10:33.490 --> 10:34.980
Is that so?

10:37.820 --> 10:40.120
You're right.

10:40.120 --> 10:42.240
I will take more time to think about it.

10:42.240 --> 10:43.310
Good.

10:43.310 --> 10:48.120
I will support you until your relationship 
with your little sister can be remedied.

10:48.120 --> 10:49.620
Me too!

11:06.900 --> 11:09.290
I'll be back, Allen.

11:18.640 --> 11:20.660
Oh wow!

11:28.870 --> 11:31.420
Yes! I did it!

11:31.730 --> 11:33.160
Thank you very much!

11:36.180 --> 11:37.310
Yay!

11:42.430 --> 11:46.430
Natalia, thank you for teaching me.

11:46.430 --> 11:49.750
Charlo, you have a knack for it.

11:49.750 --> 11:54.330
If you continue training, I'm sure 
you'll improve even further.

11:54.940 --> 11:56.060
Yes!

11:56.060 --> 11:58.520
I'm looking forward to you 
coaching me again tomorrow!

11:58.520 --> 12:00.040
Wait, tomorrow?

12:00.040 --> 12:01.880
Oh, I'm sorry.

12:01.880 --> 12:04.680
I assumed you would teach 
me again tomorrow...

12:05.730 --> 12:07.200
Natalia?

12:07.490 --> 12:10.450
I was remembering the old times.

12:10.900 --> 12:14.710
About the fun times I had 
before I came to the academy.

12:16.200 --> 12:18.740
<i>Does that memory happen to be...</i>

12:20.260 --> 12:21.460
I know!

12:21.880 --> 12:25.210
There's something I'd like 
to show you, Charlo.

12:25.210 --> 12:27.220
To me?

12:27.220 --> 12:28.120
Yes.

12:31.220 --> 12:33.730
Where, where is it?!

12:34.190 --> 12:35.490
Where did it go?!

12:35.490 --> 12:37.990
It was here when I left this morning!

12:38.300 --> 12:40.300
What are you looking for?

12:40.300 --> 12:42.480
It's gone! My bag!

12:42.480 --> 12:43.730
Your bag?

12:45.250 --> 12:48.750
Oh, is that what you wanted to show me?

12:49.990 --> 12:52.370
I can't believe I didn't lock the window.

12:52.370 --> 12:54.270
But who would do such a thing?

12:54.270 --> 12:56.000
Natalia, look!

12:57.500 --> 12:59.000
A challenge letter...

13:00.170 --> 13:02.010
As I thought, it's from Chris.

13:02.010 --> 13:04.740
"If you want your precious bag returned,

13:04.740 --> 13:07.760
come to the designated place alone," huh?

13:09.200 --> 13:10.760
Very well.

13:11.570 --> 13:13.270
He shall <i>pay</i> for this.

13:13.270 --> 13:15.310
Y-You shouldn't, Natalia!

13:15.310 --> 13:17.060
Fighting is bad...

13:17.060 --> 13:19.960
Can you please keep this 
from the Great Demon Lord?

13:19.960 --> 13:21.770
Are you planning to go alone?

13:22.110 --> 13:23.530
There's no need to worry!

13:23.530 --> 13:25.530
I shall be back soon.

13:29.990 --> 13:33.000
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

13:33.000 --> 13:36.000
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

13:37.230 --> 13:38.490
I see.

13:38.790 --> 13:43.100
Natalia is missing, and her bag 
is gone from her room as well.

13:43.100 --> 13:44.080
Yes.

13:44.080 --> 13:46.760
She didn't show up to class, so...

13:46.760 --> 13:49.200
I don't know where she could be.

13:49.200 --> 13:50.260
Lü, any ideas?

13:50.260 --> 13:54.010
Hmm, Natalia's scent isn't here.

13:54.230 --> 13:57.030
I don't believe that she, of all 
people, would be in trouble, but...

13:57.410 --> 13:58.950
Where's Charlo?

13:58.950 --> 14:02.270
I thought she was practicing 
spells with Natalia.

14:02.510 --> 14:05.020
I'll try and find mommy's scent!

14:06.040 --> 14:11.290
Perhaps Miss Natalia overheard us yesterday.

14:11.550 --> 14:14.310
<i>If that's the case, where 
could Charlotte be?</i>

14:14.530 --> 14:17.290
Master Allen, what would you like to do?

14:17.290 --> 14:19.050
Oh, there they are!

14:19.050 --> 14:22.030
You're one of Chris' underlings.

14:22.480 --> 14:24.450
No offense, but we're rather busy today—

14:24.450 --> 14:26.220
Please! We need your help!

14:26.220 --> 14:26.980
Hm?

14:26.980 --> 14:28.340
The young master...

14:28.340 --> 14:32.300
He summoned Natalia  
to the forbidden dungeon!

14:32.780 --> 14:34.110
Seriously?!

14:34.110 --> 14:35.430
That's bad!

14:35.700 --> 14:39.810
<i>Normally, that dungeon is easy enough 
for students to clear, but...</i>

14:40.260 --> 14:44.690
The dungeon boss is in her laying 
season, so she's agitated.

14:45.220 --> 14:46.460
<i>They're in danger!</i>

14:49.970 --> 14:51.940
So, you did come all the way down here.

14:51.940 --> 14:54.950
This bag must be very important to you.

14:55.200 --> 14:57.490
That's none of your business.

14:57.490 --> 14:59.220
Give it back right now!

14:59.220 --> 15:01.830
I can't return it to you so easily.

15:02.400 --> 15:04.590
I know, let's do this!

15:05.570 --> 15:06.830
What do you think you're doing?!

15:06.830 --> 15:07.840
Whoa there.

15:08.150 --> 15:10.660
A strong spell is cast on it, right?

15:10.660 --> 15:12.840
It won't break from something like this.

15:13.830 --> 15:16.890
In this dungeon, we won't be 
interrupted by the teachers.

15:16.890 --> 15:21.610
Now, let's see who can 
recover the bag first.

15:21.860 --> 15:23.170
So pathetic...

15:23.170 --> 15:25.600
You want to beat me that much?

15:25.600 --> 15:27.280
That's right!

15:27.280 --> 15:29.940
I <i>can't</i> lose to you, no matter what.

15:29.940 --> 15:32.070
Because of you, I...!

15:32.360 --> 15:34.530
Hey, wait!

15:37.250 --> 15:41.370
The young master used to be called 
a genius child in the academy.

15:45.600 --> 15:48.960
Until Natalia Evans transferred 
here, that is...

15:54.430 --> 15:55.990
Ever since then...

15:55.990 --> 15:57.150
I'm finished!

15:57.890 --> 16:02.480
In academics and in practical training, 
he's failed every attempt to beat Natalia.

16:03.170 --> 16:05.900
His pride torn to shreds, the young master...

16:07.160 --> 16:09.150
I'm <i>going</i> to beat her!

16:09.150 --> 16:11.190
By any means necessary!

16:12.780 --> 16:14.670
And last night...

16:17.440 --> 16:20.870
<i>Feeling anxious about Natalia's 
improvement under my tutelage,</i>

16:20.870 --> 16:22.800
<i>he lured her into the forbidden dungeon...</i>

16:23.180 --> 16:25.160
<i>Who knew he felt that pressured?</i>

16:25.160 --> 16:27.430
<i>I should have expected it.</i>

16:28.220 --> 16:30.220
You all stay put here.

16:30.220 --> 16:31.840
I'll go find her on my own.

16:31.840 --> 16:33.930
Will you be okay by yourself, Allen?

16:33.930 --> 16:37.340
Don't you know I'm the genius Great Demon 
Lord who can silence a crying child?

16:37.340 --> 16:41.340
I'll just get over there, give the brat 
a taste of my fist and come back.

16:43.500 --> 16:46.470
Please send word to my uncle, just in case.

16:46.470 --> 16:48.390
You never know what could happen.

16:48.390 --> 16:50.170
Understood.

16:50.680 --> 16:53.150
I'm going to look for mommy's scent.

16:53.150 --> 16:53.920
Thank you.

16:54.460 --> 16:56.350
You all wait here.

16:56.350 --> 16:57.690
Yes, sir!

17:01.110 --> 17:02.950
You aren't so bad yourself.

17:02.950 --> 17:05.260
But this settles it.

17:05.260 --> 17:07.200
I'm going to take back my bag.

17:07.200 --> 17:10.460
No, I'm not done yet...

17:18.410 --> 17:19.720
Wh-What's going on?!

17:27.860 --> 17:30.320
Th-That's a chimaera!

17:30.320 --> 17:32.350
Is that the dungeon's boss?!

17:48.730 --> 17:50.040
Hold up!

18:04.540 --> 18:06.250
It seems like it's gone.

18:06.250 --> 18:09.420
But it was pathetic of you to run.

18:09.420 --> 18:10.900
What was I supposed to do?!

18:10.900 --> 18:13.910
My body just moved on its own when I saw it!

18:15.110 --> 18:18.210
Anyhow, we need to do something 
about that chimaera.

18:18.210 --> 18:20.750
A-Are you going to fight it?

18:20.750 --> 18:26.560
No. I read that chimaera will run 
away if you make loud noises.

18:26.560 --> 18:28.700
If we use both of our magic...

18:28.700 --> 18:29.420
Hm?

18:29.420 --> 18:31.160
Are you listening to me?!

18:31.160 --> 18:34.340
I just felt something cold on my head...

18:34.340 --> 18:36.280
Maybe a drop of water?

18:36.280 --> 18:37.530
That's strange.

18:37.530 --> 18:39.690
There's no limestone cave here...

18:45.700 --> 18:46.860
Y-You stay back!

18:46.860 --> 18:47.680
Get out of here!

18:47.680 --> 18:49.440
What do you mean?!

18:49.710 --> 18:51.470
I'm the one who got you into this mess.

18:51.470 --> 18:52.870
I'll use my magic...

18:53.380 --> 18:55.190
Take this, chimaera!

19:01.220 --> 19:02.450
Did I do it?

19:02.450 --> 19:04.450
It seems to have worked.

19:11.220 --> 19:12.370
Chris!

19:48.860 --> 19:50.000
That spell...

19:53.210 --> 19:54.510
Charlo?!

19:55.560 --> 19:56.940
Natalia!

19:57.770 --> 19:58.770
Are you hurt?

20:00.380 --> 20:02.750
Are you hurt anywhere?!

20:02.750 --> 20:05.270
Just a little... on my leg.

20:08.350 --> 20:12.010
We need to get you proper treatment 
once we're out of this dungeon.

20:12.010 --> 20:14.270
Thank you... very much...

20:14.270 --> 20:17.840
Although we can't move until Chris wakes up.

20:18.320 --> 20:19.440
Charlo.

20:19.440 --> 20:22.840
The spell you cast earlier, that's 
what I taught you, correct?

20:22.840 --> 20:23.690
Yes.

20:23.690 --> 20:28.460
It was all or nothing, but I'm glad 
the magical creature ran away.

20:28.460 --> 20:30.860
It's thanks to your teaching, Natalia!

20:31.500 --> 20:32.720
Why...?

20:32.720 --> 20:33.280
Huh?

20:33.680 --> 20:36.790
That magical creature usually 
can't be beaten so easily.

20:37.090 --> 20:39.040
You simply got lucky.

20:39.480 --> 20:42.550
Charlo, why did you come to the dungeon?!

20:42.550 --> 20:45.310
I thought I told you to stay put!

20:48.370 --> 20:50.480
Because I was worried about you.

20:51.300 --> 20:55.880
No matter how strong your magic might 
be, you are still a small child.

20:56.380 --> 21:00.020
It doesn't make it okay for you 
to go to a dangerous place alone.

21:00.020 --> 21:03.070
If something happened to you, I...

21:05.070 --> 21:07.100
Charlo, why...?

21:07.100 --> 21:10.980
Why do you care that much about me?

21:10.980 --> 21:12.390
That's because...

21:15.070 --> 21:18.580
<i>I'm... I'm your...</i>

21:20.760 --> 21:22.990
I'm sorry to have caused you trouble.

21:22.990 --> 21:24.670
But this bag...

21:24.670 --> 21:28.100
I needed to retrieve it on my own.

21:30.100 --> 21:31.670
That bag...

21:31.670 --> 21:34.100
What exactly is in there?

21:34.100 --> 21:37.610
You have a little sister 
at home, do you not?

21:45.950 --> 21:49.040
<i>In this dungeon lies a magical 
creature in its laying period.</i>

21:49.630 --> 21:51.430
<i>Her name is Salamander.</i>

21:51.430 --> 21:53.360
<i>She must not be awakened!</i>

23:30.890 --> 23:33.720
I wanted to learn more naughty things...

23:33.720 --> 23:35.220
You're wrong, Charlotte.

23:35.220 --> 23:37.720
Next time is, "Naughty = Happiness."

23:35.220 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.220 --> 23:39.970
<b>Naughty = Happiness</b>

23:38.050 --> 23:39.870
Naughtiness will be with us forever.
